Welcome to Riftbond Basics featuring the

366
00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.000
ground rules. Riftbond is a trading card

367
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.000
game based on the League of Legends

368
00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.000
universe in which the aim is to score

369
00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.000
eight victory points across two

370
00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.000
different battlefields. Points are

371
00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.000
scored by moving your own units onto one

372
00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.000
of the battlefields and conquering it or

373
00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.000
by holding it for more than one turn.

374
00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.000
The different car types in Riftbound are

375
00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.000
units, gears, and spells. To play these,

376
00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.000
you must pay an energy cost, which is

377
00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.000
shown in the top left corner of the

378
00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.000
card, as well as a power cost. Energy is

379
00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.000
obtained by exhausting runes. These come

380
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.000
from the 12 card rune deck from which

381
00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.000
the top two cards are played for free at

382
00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.000
the beginning of each turn. If you

383
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.000
exhaust your runes to pay energy, you

384
00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.000
must also pay a power cost for some

385
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.000
cards. To do this, you simply place one

386
00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.000
of your runes bearing the symbol shown

387
00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.000
on the card under your rune deck. You

388
00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.000
can also use runes that are already

389
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.000
exhausted for this.

390
00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.000
The domains of the runes and the cards

391
00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.000
you play in your main and sight deck are

392
00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.000
determined by your legend. Units that

393
00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.000
you play enter the board exhausted. This

394
00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:12.000
means they cannot move until they are

395
00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.000
readied at the start of the next turn.

396
00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.000
Just like all other exhausted cards on

397
00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.000
your side, you initially play your units

398
00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.000
and gears into your base. There they are

399
00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.000
protected from combat. Gears can't get

400
00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.000
into combat. If you already control a

401
00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.000
battlefield, you also have the option to

402
00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.000
play your units directly from your hand

403
00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.000
onto it. This is where your units might

404
00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.000
comes into play. This is the number

405
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.000
shown on the top right hand corner of

406
00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.000
the units. Might represents both the

407
00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.000
attack power and the defensive stat of

408
00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.000
your units. If a player moves units into

409
00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.000
an already occupied battlefield, combat

410
00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.000
stunts. Here, spells with action and

411
00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.000
reaction speed can be activated to deal

412
00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.000
damage or modify might. When combat

413
00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.000
occurs, and no player wishes to activate

414
00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.000
any more spells or abilities, the total

415
00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.000
might of all units is added together and

416
00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:59.000
distributed amongst the opposing units.

417
00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.000
Players may decide for themselves which

418
00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.000
opposing unit they wish to damage. Once

419
00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.000
combat is over, any damage is healed by

420
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.000
units that were involved and did not

421
00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.000
die. The game ends when a player reaches

422
00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.000
eight victory points. Though this is not

423
00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.000
quite so easy to achieve, whilst every

424
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.000
other point simply requires conquering a

425
00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.000
battlefield to earn the eighth point,

426
00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.000
you must either have held a battlefield

427
00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.000
for one round or you score two points in

428
00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.000
the same round. Now you've got all the

429
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.000
information you need to know to start

430
00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:40.000
enjoying a game of Riftbound.

