Welcome to Riftbound Basics featuring

469
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.000
runes. In the Riftbound TCG, your energy

470
00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.000
to play cards comes automatically. Each

471
00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.000
player brings their own rune deck

472
00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.000
consisting of 12 cards. This consists of

473
00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.000
runes in the domains of your legend. A

474
00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:18.000
Draven deck, for example, can play Chaos

475
00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.000
and Fury runes. At the start of your

476
00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.000
turn, immediately after you have readied

477
00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.000
all your cards and received points for

478
00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.000
holding a battlefield, you may play the

479
00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:29.000
top two cards from your rune deck.

480
00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.000
You need runes to pay the energy and

481
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.000
power costs on your cards. For example,

482
00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.000
for victor leader, you must pay four

483
00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.000
energy, which means exhausting four

484
00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.000
runes of any color and then pay a power

485
00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:43.000
cost. You do this by placing a rune of

486
00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:45.000
the color shown under the energy cost at

487
00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.000
the bottom of your rune deck. This

488
00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.000
process is also called recycling.

489
00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.000
Some cards, such as Seal of Insight,

490
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.000
have no energy cost, but do have a power

491
00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.000
cost. However, to ensure your energy

492
00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.000
isn't lost, you may float the energy.

493
00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.000
That is, exhaust your runes, place them

494
00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.000
under your rune deck, and later use the

495
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.000
energy gained to play another card.

496
00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.000
Consequently, power costs have no effect

497
00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.000
on the current turn in which you play

498
00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
the cards, but can have a significant

499
00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.000
